## Game: the game's name, said once. Every program, page and footer
## takes the name from here, so a new title is a change to one line
## (docs/plan.md D14).

# :: Char
## The game's display name (a working title).
## >> "g:" u_se< "Game"
## >> g:name
## Evolving Game
l:name := "Evolving Game"
# :: Char -> Char
## The title of one of the games, the family's name before it.
## >> "g:" u_se< "Game"
## >> g:t_itle "Castle Defense"
## Evolving Game: Castle Defense
l:t_itle := { game -> l:name c_at ": " c_at game }
